{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet","content_id":"5f67dbe3-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Use the Self Assessment helpsheet (HS325) to work out your other taxable income and include this in your tax return.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9396974","isbn":"","title":"Other taxable Income (HS325)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet/other-taxable-income-2026-hs325"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69a99b0c8fd807b03bbe92df","filename":"HS325_WS1.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":210350,"filename":"HS325_WS1.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9396975","isbn":"","number_of_pages":1,"title":"Working sheet 1 for income and expenses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a99b0c8fd807b03bbe92df/HS325_WS1.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69a99b2098da555143be92d8","filename":"HS325_WS2.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":231734,"filename":"HS325_WS2.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9396976","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Working sheet 2 for income and expenses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a99b2098da555143be92d8/HS325_WS2.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Use the guides and working sheets to work out the figures for the following sections in your tax return:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>other UK income</li>\n  <li>additional information</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Previous helpsheets can be found on the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://webarchive.nationalarchives.gov.uk/ukgwa/20260709002139/https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet\">National Archives website</a>.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"'Working sheet 1' and 'Working sheet 2' for income and expenses, along with 'Other taxable Income (HS325)' for tax years 2023 to 2025 have been removed from the page. A link to the National Archives website has been added to the page.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-22T10:24:48Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 have been added for tax year 2025 to 2026. The helpsheet and working sheets have been removed for tax year 2021 to 2022.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:04Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 have been added for 2024 to 2025 tax year.  The helpsheet and working sheets have been removed for tax year 2020 to 2021.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:30:11Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 for the 2024 tax year have been added, and the 2020 helpsheet and working sheets have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:01:02Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 for the 2023 tax year have been added, and the 2019 helpsheet and working sheets have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:09Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 for the 2022 tax year have been added. We have also removed helpsheets and working sheets for 2017 and 2018.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:30:04Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 for the 2021 tax year have been added to the page.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:15:10Z"},{"note":"A new version of working sheet 2 for other taxable income 2020 has been added.","public_timestamp":"2020-11-05T09:15:20Z"},{"note":"An updated version of working sheet 2 for other taxable income 2020 has been added.","public_timestamp":"2020-10-06T08:43:06Z"},{"note":"A new version of working sheet 2 for other taxable income 2020 has been added. ","public_timestamp":"2020-04-30T15:20:23Z"},{"note":"The helpsheet and working sheets 1 and 2 have been added for the tax year 2019 to 2020.","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:15:10Z"},{"note":"Self Assessment helpsheet HS325 and working sheets 1 and 2 for the 2019 tax year have been added to the page.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:15:01Z"},{"note":"The helpsheet and the working sheets have been added for the tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2018-04-06T00:45:13Z"},{"note":"The helpsheet and the working sheets have been added for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:15:20Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:30:51Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2015 to 2016.","public_timestamp":"2015-04-13T12:36:30Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2014-07-03T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidance","emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"featured_attachments":["9396974","9396975","9396976"],"first_public_at":"2014-07-04T00:00:00.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"guidance","first_published_at":"2014-07-04T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet","base_path":"/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet","content_id":"5f67dbe3-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","doc